  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIE Fanka Capacity Building Project (Prodac)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Horticulture , Beneficiaries: 172 Women, Description: This project is a joint activity between the GOS and USADF, as part of the YesAgriSen program, outcome of a MOU between the two parties. Activities to be undertaken (gardening) will be a means to fight against poverty, rural exodus and youth unemployment. Funding will be used to expand the area under production and increase technical and financial management capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
